# Protected paths. The Gate (scripts/autopilot.ts) never auto-merges a PR touching these; it labels
# them needs-human. With GitHub Pro, also enable "Require review from Code Owners" on main.
# Supported shapes: /dir/ (prefix) and /file (exact).

# The loop's own guardrails: an agent must never be able to loosen the rules it is judged by
/.github/ @alcheny
/scripts/autopilot.ts @alcheny
/scripts/autopilot.test.ts @alcheny
/scripts/team.ts @alcheny
/scripts/team.test.ts @alcheny
/scripts/plan.ts @alcheny
/scripts/plan.test.ts @alcheny
/scripts/doctor.ts @alcheny
/scripts/doctor.test.ts @alcheny
/scripts/invariants.test.ts @alcheny

# Legal and security policy (docs/POLICY.md) and its enforcement: owner only, never agents
/docs/POLICY.md @alcheny
/SECURITY.md @alcheny
/scripts/compliance.ts @alcheny
/scripts/compliance.test.ts @alcheny
/scripts/policy.test.ts @alcheny
/scripts/workflow-security.test.ts @alcheny

# Feature pipeline (docs/FEATURES.md): its script and process are owner-only. Feature files themselves
# (docs/features/) are the owner's decisions, written in design sessions; agents can't edit them.
/scripts/features.ts @alcheny
/scripts/features.test.ts @alcheny
/docs/FEATURES.md @alcheny
/docs/AUTOPILOT.md @alcheny
/team/ @alcheny
/.claude/agents/ @alcheny
/CLAUDE.md @alcheny
/playwright.config.ts @alcheny

# Product decisions (CEO-owned); DECISIONS.md is written only by the Choose and Judge workflows
/docs/DESIGN.md @alcheny
/docs/DECISIONS.md @alcheny

# Security and credentials
/lib/session.ts @alcheny
/lib/broker.ts @alcheny

# Supply chain: new or changed dependencies
/package.json @alcheny
/package-lock.json @alcheny
